"0.2, name: ''}\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/services/Working-with-services/Understanding-ROS2-Services/Understanding-ROS2-Services.rst:368
msgid ""
"On distributions older than Kilted, use the type ``turtlesim/srv/Spawn`` "
